               x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17
               x18 x19 (Z_to_bv 64 1) s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 x28 x29 x30 x31)
          F (Z_to_bv 64 0x43780) fc None mc (seg_rom bsegs)).
